# CARTO Basemap API Key (optional)
# As of August 2026, CARTO requires a free API key to use their basemap tiles without an "API KEY REQUIRED" watermark.
# You can get a free key instantly (with 5 million requests/month) at:
# https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey
#
# If left blank, the app automatically falls back to a clean, keyless grayscale canvas basemap.
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=

# Telegram Bot Feedback Forwarding (optional)
# Create a bot via @BotFather and retrieve chat ID via getUpdates.
# For Cloudflare Workers, set via `wrangler secret put TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`.
# For Netlify, set in Site configuration -> Environment variables.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=5007040501

# The same two variables also send the API-trouble alerts (#144): a message when EMT or FGV refuses or rate-limits
# a client, with the request rate that preceded it, and another when it answers again. Set them in Netlify.

# Optional passenger navigation services. No public demo is configured by default.
# Photon-compatible endpoint operated/approved for your deployment:
PLACE_SEARCH_URL=
# Fixed local OpenTripPlanner GraphQL endpoint:
OTP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8801/otp/gtfs/v1
# Native builds need a reachable HTTPS navigation API; web defaults to same-origin.
VITE_NAVIGATION_API_URL=
# Optional comma-separated cross-origin callers; defaults allow Capacitor localhost origins.
# NAVIGATION_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=capacitor://localhost,https://localhost,http://localhost
